+
+3. **Location:** Chapter 60, final paragraph beginning “He had spent the whole year learning...” **Observed issue:** The close restates the already powerful “He fit” realization and advances from observed experience to the more categorical claims that the place was built to end him and that he is the pattern. **Effect on the reader:** The explanation slightly blunts the quiet force of Chapter 59, reduces productive mystery, and can make Cael sound more certain than his evidence-keeping character has allowed himself to be. **Proposed scope:** Tighten the paragraph to the smallest forward-looking inference Cael can honestly own, or end closer to the westward departure and the felt fact of belonging; keep stronger cosmological claims explicitly provisional. **Strength to preserve:** The reversal from lifelong exclusion to bodily recognition is the movement's central payoff and should remain unmistakable.

